<title>JAPAN: Tokai Bank says bad loan write-off plan in place.</title>
<headline>Tokai Bank says bad loan write-off plan in place.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokai Bank Ltd has worked out plans to complete writing off its bad loans, a senior official told a news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>The official did not specifically say when the bank would complete its write-offs.</p>
</text>
